#: ../../tools/cosmic_tools.rst:74 7c2f7e4fae0c4b0fb851b6b90039ccdc
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search COSMIC database for somatic mutations in cancer. "
"COSMIC is the world's largest expert-curated database of somatic "
"mutations in human cancer. Search by gene name, mutation ID, or mutation "
"description. Returns mutation IDs, gene names, CDS changes, and amino "
"acid changes. No authentication required."
msgstr ""

